Name: SpeechBrain VoxLingua107 ECAPA language identification
Short Name: lang-id-voxlingua107-ecapa
URL: https://huggingface.co/speechbrain/lang-id-voxlingua107-ecapa
Version: lid.onnx sha256 7cfabee2653ac9d6e80f9f766514dedb0983fc6cd6e078b499fc6d644164f0a4
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
SpeechBrain's ECAPA-TDNN spoken-language classifier (Apache-2.0). Tark's
live captions (D4) run it on a call's first seconds of speech to work out
which language the client speaks.

The model is trained on the VoxLingua107 dataset by Jörgen Valk and Tanel
Alumäe, "VoxLingua107: a Dataset for Spoken Language Recognition" (IEEE SLT
2021), https://bark.phon.ioc.ee/voxlingua107/, licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Tark ships no part of the
dataset itself.

Local Modifications:
Exported to ONNX by utils/lid_export.py: SpeechBrain's Fbank front end is
rebuilt from ONNX operators (the STFT as a convolution with fixed DFT
weights); the weights are unchanged.
